WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Meet RunLume, a local-first dashboard for AI coding sessions.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
This is the real application using synthetic data; no personal transcript is included.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The live overview shows token flow, cost coverage, code impact, and tool reliability.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Verified rates power cost estimates, while unknown models stay unpriced.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Provider comparison separates sources from Nemotron, Kimi K3, GLM 5.2, Qwen 3.6, and Mistral.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.500
Successful tool results drive workflow metrics.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.600
Trajectories are redacted by default, and everything stays on localhost without telemetry.
